Package: com.samcejko.tikieplus
Name: TikTak+
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Direct TikTok viewer with Explore, public profiles, video and photo playback, comments, saved posts and verified local session import. No helper server required; some TikTok account/search endpoints may be unavailable.
Maintainer: samcejko
Author: samcejko
Section: Multimedia
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 11.0)
